      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this would better be optional.\n\nAlso, for now, you can make it scale properly with the ApplyTransformScale property (which makes the Z scale affect the distance). And to change the Z scale, maybe you can use scale constraints to copy the scale of the avatar to the raycast object. (I haven't used VRCRaycast yet so I'm not sure if it will work.)",
